        "Codex adapter now sends the bounded InfRing context envelope over stdin instead of argv, reducing prompt argument bloat while preserving Gateway-owned context shaping.",
        "Live InfRing harness run 20260608184930-d3f00d9f completed codex_cli command_run_smoke through the Shell socket with the bounded stdin context envelope active."
